  <p><em>Last updated: 21 July 2026</em></p>
  <p>These terms are an agreement between you and Automonie. By creating an account or using the app, you agree to them. Please read them, particularly the sections on what Automonie is not, and on savings plans.</p>

  <h2>1. The service</h2>
  <p>Automonie is a personal finance management tool. It helps you record and categorise transactions, set budgets and goals, track bills and debts, automate savings, and view insights about your money. It is available on the web and on Android.</p>

  <h2>2. Your account</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You must be at least 18 years old and provide accurate registration details.</li>
    <li>You are responsible for keeping your password, PIN and device secure, and for activity that happens under your account.</li>
    <li>Enable two-step verification and app lock where available.</li>
    <li>Tell us immediately at <a href="mailto:tobe@automonie.com">tobe@automonie.com</a> if you suspect unauthorised access.</li>
    <li>One person, one account. Don't share your account with others.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. What Automonie is not</h2>
  <p>This section matters, so we've kept it plain:</p>
