    <li>Automonie is not a bank and does not take deposits in its own right.</li>
    <li>We do not provide financial, investment, tax or legal advice. Insights, scores, forecasts and suggestions in the app are informational only, generated from the data available to us. They are not a recommendation to take any particular financial action. Decisions about your money are yours.</li>
