  <h2>4. Linked bank accounts</h2>
  <p>Linking a bank account is optional. If you link one, you authorise us and our open-banking provider to retrieve transaction and account information on your behalf, on a read-only basis. We cannot move money from a linked account. You may disconnect at any time from the app, which stops further retrieval immediately.</p>

