    <li>You may not use Automonie for money laundering, fraud, terrorist financing or any unlawful purpose.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>6. Savings goals and locked plans</h2>
  <p>You can lock a savings goal until a chosen date. Where a locked plan offers a return, the applicable rate and any early-withdrawal charge are shown in the app at the time you create the plan.</p>
  <p>Any return is variable and depends on the performance of the underlying product provided by our partner. Rates are not guaranteed and may change. Breaking a locked plan before its maturity date may reduce or forfeit any accrued return and may incur a charge, as disclosed in the app.</p>

